{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《QuellCut》是一款專為影片創作者而設的智能剪輯工具，可自動偵測並刪去影片中的靜音、填充詞與重複內容。無論你是 podcast 製作人、YouTuber、教育工作者還是內容創作者，都可以大幅縮短剪輯時間。App 原價 US $0.99，目前限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>自動偵測靜音與填充詞</h2>\n<p>QuellCut 能自動偵測並移除影片中的靜音段落、填充詞與重複內容，亦可提取最吸引人的片段並輸出為 9:16 Shorts。內建調色、音訊標準化與敏感度預設，並全程在裝置端處理，保障私隱。無論是 podcast、YouTube、教學或直播影片，甚至長達 24 小時的檔案，都能快速完成剪輯。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-550-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-551-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-552-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-553-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-554-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-555-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：QuellCut – Silence Remover</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T22:32:48.828402+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":352,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}